  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general internet audience familiar with internet meme formats and humor. The target community includes users who recognize the 'brace yourself, disappointment is coming' format and appreciate ironic or humorous juxtapositions. The use of a recognizable actor (Roy Bishop) and a common meme template makes it accessible to a wide demographic, particularly those active on social media platforms where such memes circulate. The visual and textual elements are designed to be universally understandable, relying on the contrast between smug confidence and impending letdown, which appeals to users who enjoy self-deprecating or ironic humor.",
